Midi2DMXnow
----
- Long push screen: set all receiver in Wifi + OTA mode


DMXnow2Strip
----
- inbuilt led (red on boot, green after DMX frame received)
- OTA flash (switch to wifi+OTA from a special Sender message)
- delay on boot (prevent too fast boot...)


Controller
----
- get values from sender (ie for scene load set faders)
- launcher (check unique, more beautifull)


All
----
- distinct id/channel for animation offset


Animation:
Rainbow = set start and stop color

Chase: BPM sync
